{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学似乎很冷，走到了火炉旁，\\n对着手掌哈气。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "濑名同学似乎很冷，走到了火炉旁，对着手掌哈气。", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「发生什么了吗，濑名同学？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚才我在公寓附近看到了这小家伙，我还以为它在散步」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「刚才我在公寓附近看到了这小家伙，我还以为它在散步」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4468", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚才？但熊喵一直都在活动室里……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，那应该是我看错了吧……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4469", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她一开始说自己就当个幽灵社员，\\n但她只要有时间就都会来到活动室。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "虽然她一开始说自己就当个幽灵社员，但她只要有时间就都会来到活动室。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在已经习惯与熊喵相处了，还会给熊喵喂罐头吃。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "现在已经习惯与熊喵相处了，还会给熊喵喂罐头吃。", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵也会在濑名同学脚下撒娇，向她露出自己的肚子。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到居然能看到这副场景……", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼，今天外面好冷……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3453", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
