{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「发生了什么吗，安洁？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比濑名同学还要忙得多的她也会在闲下来的时候到活动室里来。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "比濑名同学还要忙得多的她也会在闲下来的时候到活动室里来。", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过为什么会说熊喵会瞬移……", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「刚才我在各务台商场购物的时候，看到熊喵在那边慢悠悠溜达来着」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「刚才我在各务台商场购物的时候，看到熊喵在那边慢悠悠溜达来着」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3455", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没想到回活动室居然比以光速赶回来的安洁还要快」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "「没想到回活动室居然比以光速赶回来的安洁还要快」", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3456", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然发言者的发言有夸张的部分，\\n但没想到又出现了关于熊喵的可疑目击情报……", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "虽然发言者的发言有夸张的部分，但没想到又出现了关于熊喵的可疑目击情报……", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在各务台商场吗，\\n　可熊喵一直都在活动室里啊？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "「在各务台商场吗，　可熊喵一直都在活动室里啊？」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4470", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
