{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但也不能确定它就是熊喵的母亲……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么少见的动物哪是到处都有的。\\n　而且那一只还带着只很小的熊喵」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「这么少见的动物哪是到处都有的。　而且那一只还带着只很小的熊喵」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1618", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个说不定是熊喵的弟弟妹妹」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1619", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
