{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我能感受到学姐现在很困惑。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果这是真的，\\n那熊喵也要和其他动物一样被放回到自然。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "如果这是真的，那熊喵也要和其他动物一样被放回到自然。", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这对学姐来说，并不是一件简单的事。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵和其他没有取名字的动物不一样。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们是将它作为真正的家人一样去对待的。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，你的母亲还活着哦。\\n　真是太好了」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "「小熊喵，你的母亲还活着哦。　真是太好了」", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2154", "char_id": "みう"}]}
