{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这之后学姐没有再说话，\\n就只是沉默地抱着熊喵……", "text_idx": 391, "plain": "这之后学姐没有再说话，就只是沉默地抱着熊喵……", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天在学姐打工回来之前，\\n我都打算在她家等着。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "今天在学姐打工回来之前，我都打算在她家等着。", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐因为熊喵的事很没有精神，\\n在她回家之前我都放不下心。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "学姐因为熊喵的事很没有精神，在她回家之前我都放不下心。", "plain_idx": 396, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样呀。发现熊喵的母亲了啊」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0186", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐在知道这件事后，似乎很不知所措」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想也是。\\n　毕竟她很宠爱熊喵……」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「我想也是。　毕竟她很宠爱熊喵……」", "plain_idx": 402, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0187", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐真的没事吗」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的没事的。这不是还有你在吗♪」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0188", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说实话，我也不知道我能为现在的学姐做些什么。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": "说实话，我也不知道我能为现在的学姐做些什么。", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我甚至不知道自己现在应不应该和大家一起寻找有关熊喵母亲的线索。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "我甚至不知道自己现在应不应该和大家一起寻找有关熊喵母亲的线索。", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……之前有和你说过来着」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0189", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在美羽小的时候，小猫因为生病去世了，\\n　她就开始变得害怕饲养动物了……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": "「在美羽小的时候，小猫因为生病去世了，　她就开始变得害怕饲养动物了……」", "plain_idx": 412, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0190", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你说过」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我其实也有过那样的经历。\\n　小的时候，有在老家养过猫……」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "「我其实也有过那样的经历。　小的时候，有在老家养过猫……」", "plain_idx": 416, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0191", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在那只猫年老去世后，\\n　我也想过不再养宠物了」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": "「在那只猫年老去世后，　我也想过不再养宠物了」", "plain_idx": 419, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0192", "char_id": "結子"}]}
