{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽在看到多蒙和卡琳的时候肯定很痛苦吧……」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "「美羽在看到多蒙和卡琳的时候肯定很痛苦吧……」", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0194", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是学姐还是非常喜欢有关猫的东西的」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但这些小猫也仍然只是“妈妈的猫”，\\n　她没有再朝前方迈步了……」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": "「但这些小猫也仍然只是“妈妈的猫”，　她没有再朝前方迈步了……」", "plain_idx": 432, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0195", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而她对熊喵也……」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0196", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有一天她能想通，重新和动物们一起生活就好了♪」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": "「如果有一天她能想通，重新和动物们一起生活就好了♪」", "plain_idx": 436, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0197", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是这么希望的。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不去逃避自己喜欢的东西，而是去爱着对方。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……结子阿姨，\\n　你是为什么又重新养起猫的？」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": "「那个……结子阿姨，　你是为什么又重新养起猫的？」", "plain_idx": 441, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0198", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……应该是因为当上了母亲吧」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0199", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "卡琳", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵——」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "kr0007", "char_id": "カリン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "多蒙", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喵——」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "dm0007", "char_id": "ドモン"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "结子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乖、乖，想吃零食了吧。\\n　你俩跟我来吧」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": "「乖、乖，想吃零食了吧。　你俩跟我来吧」", "plain_idx": 448, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "yk0200", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "起身向厨房走去的结子阿姨的样子，\\n和美羽学姐的样子真像。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": "起身向厨房走去的结子阿姨的样子，和美羽学姐的样子真像。", "plain_idx": 451, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望学姐有一天也能和她一样走出来。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她和最喜欢的猫猫们一起生活的样子。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我比谁都更想在她的身边见证。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，让你一直等了这么久」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2156", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打工辛苦了」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2157", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？我脸上有什么奇怪的东西吗？」", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有，只是很想看看你的脸♪」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2158", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这么说，感觉有点害羞」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，明明我们在交往？」", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2159", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、换我看着学姐，感觉怎么样」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2160", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "立场一下子反过来了。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确、确实，稍微有些让人害羞……」", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2161", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐中途就脸红了起来，真是可爱。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么看来学姐还是和平常一样，没有问题……", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，对了对了。关于熊喵的事……」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2162", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果能找到它的母亲，\\n　我想直接放它回归自然」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": "「如果能找到它的母亲，　我想直接放它回归自然」", "plain_idx": 477, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2163", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面前的笑容有些勉强。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那位妈妈的话，肯定能让小熊喵幸福的吧♪」", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2164", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但这应该就是学姐做出的选择吧。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我也只能支持她了。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "陪在她身边，看着她。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那从明天开始，一起加油找熊喵母亲的线索吧」", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，尽早找到它，\\n　让小熊喵开心吧」", "text_idx": 486, "plain": "「嗯，尽早找到它，　让小熊喵开心吧」", "plain_idx": 487, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2165", "char_id": "みう"}]}
